{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000186153","approvedSymbol":"WWOX","functionDescriptions":["Putative oxidoreductase. Acts as a tumor suppressor and plays a role in apoptosis. Required for normal bone development (By similarity). May function synergistically with p53/TP53 to control genotoxic stress-induced cell death. Plays a role in TGFB1 signaling and TGFB1-mediated cell death. May also play a role in tumor necrosis factor (TNF)-mediated cell death. Inhibits Wnt signaling, probably by sequestering DVL2 in the cytoplasm. {ECO:0000250, ECO:0000269|PubMed:11719429, ECO:0000269|PubMed:15070730, ECO:0000269|PubMed:15548692, ECO:0000269|PubMed:16061658, ECO:0000269|PubMed:16219768, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19366691, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19465938}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q9NZC7","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A0D9SER1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A411HBC7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A804HJX9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F5H3R5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"H3BMD1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000348119","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000384238","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000384495","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000386161","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000445210","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000454331","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000454485","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000454788","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000457230","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000485925","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000507689","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000704328","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000704329","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000733810","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000733811","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000789951","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000814213","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"A8K323","source":"uniprot_obsolete"},{"id":"Q5MYT5","source":"uniprot_obsolete"},{"id":"Q96KM3","source":"uniprot_obsolete"},{"id":"Q96RF2","source":